      "versionNonce": 1156570858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743347572323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design facebook news feed\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n- Create posts\n- Follow other users\n- View others posts from people they follow\n\n-- Out of scope --\n- \n\nScale:\n1. Celebrity: User has 200M followers\n2. 500M users - 20M DAU\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. Scalable - create posts, following \n2. Availability >> consistency\n3. Eventual consistency\n4. Low latency - fetching of posts ( < 500ms)\n\nAssumptions:\n\n1. Scale - 20M DAU ~ 100M reads\n2. Writes - 1 : 10 ratio ~ 10M writes\n~ read heavy system\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. User\n2. Post\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design facebook news feed\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n- Create posts\n- Follow other users\n- View others posts from people they follow\n\n-- Out of scope --\n- \n\nScale:\n1. Celebrity: User has 200M followers\n2. 500M users - 20M DAU\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. Scalable - create posts, following \n2. Availability >> consistency\n3. Eventual consistency\n4. Low latency - fetching of posts ( < 500ms)\n\nAssumptions:\n\n1. Scale - 20M DAU ~ 100M reads\n2. Writes - 1 : 10 ratio ~ 10M writes\n~ read heavy system\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. User\n2. Post\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
